The release bundles QSMxT 9.22.0 unmodified, as published by the QSMxT
project with SHA256SUMS:
https://github.com/QSMxT/QSMxT/releases/tag/v9.22.0
Source: https://github.com/QSMxT/QSMxT/tree/v9.22.0
QSMxT is GPL-3.0-only (LICENSE). It is built on qsm-core v0.38.0
(https://github.com/astewartau/QSM.rs/tree/v0.38.0), which the QSMbly web app
also runs, compiled to WebAssembly. qsmxt.json pins each archive's SHA-256.

QSMxT's archives include dcm2niix (https://github.com/rordenlab/dcm2niix);
its license is in app/native/dcm2niix.LICENSE.

Deep-learning weights are not included. They are downloaded on first use from
the Hugging Face repository qsmxt/qsm-onnx-weights at the commit pinned in
model.manifest.json; each model keeps its authors' license.
